    {
      "content": "function outer() {\n   let data = \"secret\";\n}\n\nconsole.log(data);\n// Error! \n// \"data\" is trapped inside.",
      "animationType": "typewriter",
      "fontSize": 80,
      "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "fontWeight": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "animationDuration": 4500,
      "pauseDuration": 4000
    },
    {
      "content": "This is Scope.\n\nBut Closures break\nthis rule. \n\nHere is how...",
      "animationType": "typewriter",
      "fontSize": 80,
      "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "fontWeight": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "animationDuration": 2500,
      "pauseDuration": 2000
    },
    {
      "content": "function outer() {\n   let data = \"alive!\";\n\n   return function inner() {\n       return data;\n   };\n}",
      "animationType": "typewriter",
      "fontSize": 80,
      "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "fontWeight": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "animationDuration": 5000,
      "pauseDuration": 4000
    },
    {
      "content": "const myFunc = outer();\n\n// \"outer\" is finished.\n// But...\n\nconsole.log(myFunc());\n// Output: \"alive!\" ",
      "animationType": "typewriter",
      "fontSize": 80,
      "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "fontWeight": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "animationDuration": 4500,
      "pauseDuration": 4000
    },
    {
      "content": "How did it remember?\n\nThe inner function\nformed a Closure.\n\nIt \"closed over\" the variable\nand kept it in a backpack. ",
      "animationType": "typewriter",
      "fontSize": 80,
      "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "fontWeight": "normal",
